_Written by `claude-4` (claude, `opus`, strong) ([run](https://github.com/Jlore-Studios/JackiOh/actions/runs/43126873421)) before anyone built this. The night bot's builder starts from this section: edit it here to change the plan._

## Goal

Two changes to the practice AI, each with a ruling, tests and docs:

1. **Shortlist (R3696000).** Sometimes the plain ranking keeps no line that hands the turn over with a delayed entry of the seat's own that its root did not hold (Supply Drop's countdown, Mind Games' reward). Then `shortlist_lines` adds the best such line, last. That is at most one more reply.
2. **Reply (R3696001).** While the imagined opponent holds a known card that its turn's cleanup discards, `known_play` judges every play, and standing still, after its turn ends. A card that guesses an unrevealed secret of the AI's (Fortify Mind) is tried with one guess. That guess is drawn before anything is weighed, so it never depends on the secret.

